stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Cold
    Cold --> AdmissionRequest: ExternalRequest

    AdmissionRequest --> IsolatedSession: Validation + authentication + policy pass
    AdmissionRequest --> Rejected: Validation/auth/policy failure

    IsolatedSession --> SoftReset: Transient fault
    IsolatedSession --> Revoked: Expiry / user revocation / integrity failure / budget exhausted

    SoftReset --> AdmissionRequest: Retry authorized
    SoftReset --> Revoked: Expiry / revocation / integrity failure / restart

    Rejected --> EvidenceSeal: Evidence written
    Revoked --> EvidenceSeal: Evidence written
    EvidenceSeal --> Cold: Restarted; transient state cleared
